I don't see how that would work.  It looks to me like the first {sa da} would
strip out {lo cukta} and replace it with {da}, leaving {mi vecnu do da}, then
the next {sa lo cukta} would turn it into {mi vecnu do lo cukta}, and then a
final {do} for {mi vecnu do lo cukta do}.
